    schema1:name "Disclosure 403-2-c covers the right of workers to refuse or stop unsafe or unhealthy work. Workers have the right to rem"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:text "Disclosure 403-2-c covers the right of workers to refuse or stop unsafe or unhealthy work. Workers have the right to remove themselves from work situations that they believe could cause them or another person injury or ill health.\\nGRI 403: Occupational Health and Safety 2018 12"^^xsd:string .

