rso:Disclosure_Disclosure_403_4_b_requires_a_description_of_wheth a rso:Disclosure ;
    rso:belongsToTopic rso:Topic_GRI_403_Occupational_Health_and_Safety_2018_3 ;
    rso:originalText "Disclosure 403-4-b requires a description of whether and, if so, why any workers are not represented by these committees. It does not require information on which workers are or are not members of such committees.\\nGuidance for clause 1.4 Agreements at the local level typically include topics such as provision of personal protective equipment; participation of workers’ representatives in health and safety inspections, audits, and incident investigations; provision of training and education; and protection against reprisals.\\nAgreements at the global level typically include topics such as compliance with the ILO’s International Labour Standards; arrangements or structures for resolving problems; and commitments regarding occupational health and safety standards and levels of performance.\\nGRI 403: Occupational Health and Safety 2018 14\\nGRI 403: Occupational Health and Safety 2018 15"^^xsd:string ;
    rso:pageEnd 15 ;
    rso:pageStart 13 ;
    rso:sectionLabel "Disclosure 403-4-b requires a description of whether and, if so, why any workers are not represented by these committees"^^xsd:string ;
    rso:sourceDocument "GRI 403_ Occupational Health and Safety 2018.pdf"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:identifier "Disclosure 403-4-b requires a description of wheth"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:name "Disclosure 403-4-b requires a description of whether and, if so, why any workers are not represented by these committees"^^xsd:string ;
    schema1:text "Disclosure 403-4-b requires a description of whether and, if so, why any workers are not represented by these committees. It does not require information on which workers are or are not members of such committees.\\nGuidance for clause 1.4 Agreements at the local level typically include topics such as provision of personal protective equipment; participation of workers’ representatives in health and safety inspections, audits, and incident investigations; provision of training and education; and protection against reprisals.\\nAgreements at the global level typically include topics such as compliance with the ILO’s International Labour Standards; arrangements or structures for resolving problems; and commitments regarding occupational health and safety standards and levels of performance.\\nGRI 403: Occupational Health and Safety 2018 14\\nGRI 403: Occupational Health and Safety 2018 15"^^xsd:string .

rso:Disclosure_Disclosure_403_6_Promotion_of_worker_health_16 a rso:Disclosure ;
    rso:belongsToTopic rso:Topic_GRI_403_Occupational_Health_and_Safety_2018_3 ;
    rso:originalText "Disclosure 403-6 Promotion of worker health 16"^^xsd:string ;
