 Framework Initiative (AFi), Operational Guidance on Cutoff Dates , 2019. 93.\\nConsumer Goods Forum (CGF), Zero Net Deforestation Resolution and Commitments , 2018. 94.\\nUnited Nations (UN), New York Declaration on Forests , 2017. 95."^^xsd:string,
