        "Disclosure 308-1 New suppliers that were screened using environmental criteria\\nThe reporting organization shall report the following information: REQUIREMENTS\\nPercentage of new suppliers that were screened using environmental criteria. a.\\nGuidance for Disclosure 308-1 Environmental criteria can include the topics covered in other GRI Topic Standards (e.g., GRI 302: Energy 2016 , GRI 303: Water and Effluents 2018 , GRI 305: Emissions 2016 )"^^xsd:string ;
