        "Topic Standard\\nDisclosures 306-1, 306-2, 306-4, and 306-5 in GRI 306: Effluents and Waste 2016 are no longer in effect and have been blacked out in this Standard. These disclosures have been revised and superseded by GRI 303: Water and Effluents 2018 and GRI 306: Waste 2020 ."^^xsd:string ;
